AI-Powered Multi-Source Phishing Prevention Platform

Project Description

An AI-powered phishing detection platform that scans URLs, QR codes, emails, and messages to identify potential threats and help users stay safe from online scams.

Objectives

- Detect suspicious URLs and phishing links.
- Identify potentially malicious links embedded in QR codes.
- Analyze emails for phishing indicators.
- Identify suspicious messages and potential scams.
- Promote cybersecurity awareness and safer online communication.

Key Features

1. URL Scanner
Analyzes URLs to identify suspicious patterns and potential phishing threats.

2. QR Code Scanner
Extracts URLs from QR codes and checks for potentially malicious links.

3. Email Analyzer
Examines email content, links, and suspicious patterns to identify potential phishing attempts.

4. Message Analyzer
Analyzes text messages for suspicious links and common scam indicators.

Technology Stack

- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Backend: Python
- AI/ML: Phishing detection and threat classification
- Version Control: Git and GitHub

Expected Outcome

The platform aims to provide a centralized solution for identifying potential phishing threats across multiple digital communication channels, helping users make informed decisions and improve their online security.

Future Enhancements

- Real-time phishing detection.
- Machine learning-based threat classification.
- Integration with threat intelligence databases.
- Browser extension and mobile application support.

